00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.220
- Okay, so heat stroke
is really dangerous,

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:00.840
especially in environments like this

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:02.910
because you lose the ability to cool off.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.850
